					"content": "Okay, then maybe you could help explain why a kitsune would have any interest in Fried Tofu.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401115305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Charlotte"
				},
				{
